  "totalBlocks": 51,
  "translatedBlocks": 40,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02d265d15b76ef91",
      "translationZh": "更新：此服务已弃用，自2025年4月10日起不再可用。作为替代方案，你可以考虑 Inference Providers。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71ea0eca9b280805",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们非常高兴地宣布推出 Hugging Face NVIDIA NIM API (serverless)，这是 Hugging Face Hub 上的一项新服务，面向 Enterprise Hub 组织开放。这项新服务让你能够轻松使用开放模型，借助 NVIDIA DGX Cloud 加速计算平台提供推理服务。我们构建这一解决方案，是为了让 Enterprise Hub 用户能够轻松地以无服务器方式访问最新的 NVIDIA AI 技术，在 Hugging Face Hub 内通过标准化 API 和几行代码，对包括 Llama 和 Mistral 在内的热门生成式 AI 模型运行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9236102c0f6dc552",
      "translationZh": "由 NVIDIA NIM 提供支持的无服务器推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88ceace01bb03374",
      "translationZh": "这一全新体验建立在我们与 NVIDIA 的合作基础之上，旨在简化在 NVIDIA 加速计算平台上访问和使用开放生成式 AI 模型的过程。开发者和组织面临的主要挑战之一，是基础设施的前期成本，以及优化 LLM 推理工作负载的复杂性。通过 Hugging Face NVIDIA NIM API (serverless)，我们为这些挑战提供了一种简单的解决方案：借助一个用于运行推理的简单 API，即可即时访问针对 NVIDIA 基础设施优化的前沿开放生成式 AI 模型。按使用量付费的定价模式确保你只需为实际使用的请求时间付费，使其成为适合各种规模企业的经济之选。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26ec5523d5f1f962",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA NIM API (serverless) 与 Train on DGX Cloud 相辅相成，后者是 Hugging Face 上已经提供的一项 AI 训练服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62ceaa07d99310b8",
      "translationZh": "使用 Hugging Face 模型运行无服务器推理从未如此简单。以下是帮助你入门的分步指南：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f138f3ab1d8be9e",
      "translationZh": "注意：要运行推理，你需要拥有对一个已订阅 Hugging Face Enterprise Hub 的组织的访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0804bde59f8d1db",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，请确保你满足以下要求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70da83ac347f3007",
      "translationZh": "你是某个 Enterprise Hub 组织的成员。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2419f6fad8faf492",
      "translationZh": "你已为你的组织创建了一个细粒度令牌。请按照以下步骤创建你的令牌。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3c581b18fb2d1946",
      "translationZh": "创建细粒度令牌",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64d8e6d1f601b6cf",
      "translationZh": "细粒度令牌允许用户创建具有特定权限的令牌，以便对资源和命名空间进行精确的访问控制。首先，前往 Hugging Face Access Tokens，点击“Create new Token”，然后选择“fine-grained”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07642e2ccd2a0b3a",
      "translationZh": "输入“Token name”，在“org permissions”中选择你的 Enterprise 组织作为作用域，然后点击“Create token”。你无需选择任何额外的作用域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42faa898f26d067e",
      "translationZh": "现在，请务必保存此令牌值，以便稍后对你的请求进行身份验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "288e7ca9d071c0ab",
      "translationZh": "查找你的 NIM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a1f4b7cc1a66b30",
      "translationZh": "你可以在受支持的生成式 AI 模型页面上找到“NVIDIA NIM API (serverless)”。你可以在这个 NVIDIA NIM Collection 以及定价部分中找到所有受支持的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10b1d99c705eec6c",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct。前往 meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct 的模型卡，打开“Deploy”菜单，然后选择“NVIDIA NIM API (serverless)”——这将打开一个界面，其中包含预先生成的 Python、Javascript 或 Curl 代码片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fa0a09139553c7ed",
      "translationZh": "发送你的请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4caf9f67096d4cf",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA NIM API (serverless) 以 OpenAI API 为标准。这使你能够使用 openai SDK 进行推理。将 YOUR_FINE_GRAINED_TOKEN_HERE 替换为你的细粒度令牌，即可运行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0866542ee2a6188",
      "translationZh": "恭喜！🎉 你现在可以开始使用开放模型构建生成式 AI 应用程序了。🔥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "144ec2aee0ebe596",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA NIM API (serverless) 目前仅支持 chat.completions.create 和 models.list API。我们正在努力扩展支持范围，同时添加更多模型。可以使用 models.list 检查当前有哪些模型可用于推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "714089492ff8a832",
      "translationZh": "支持的模型和定价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb217cc0a4ca31d1",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face NVIDIA NIM API (serverless) 的使用费用根据每次请求所消耗的计算时间计收。我们仅使用 NVIDIA H100 Tensor Core GPUs，价格为每小时 $8.25。为了让按请求定价更容易理解，我们可以将其换算为每秒的价格。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b40b2c62bac93d3",
      "translationZh": "每小时 $8.25 = 每秒 $0.0023（四舍五入至小数点后 4 位）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b766dfdd1975fa9",
      "translationZh": "一次请求的总成本取决于模型大小、所需的 GPU 数量以及处理该请求所花费的时间。以下列出了我们目前提供的模型、各自所需的 GPU 数量、典型响应时间以及每次请求的估算成本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "089ef2b6dbb34fa9",
      "translationZh": "模型 ID",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ec8ace9fe01745d",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA H100 GPU 数量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6327cb0f44c0387a",
      "translationZh": "典型响应时间（500 个输入 token，100 个输出 token）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a44f5b6464e72b1",
      "translationZh": "每次请求的估算成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9f6394137cb49f0",
      "translationZh": "1 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5a3319576b25975",
      "translationZh": "2 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be553746177a9ec4",
      "translationZh": "5 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22755889331c73ad",
      "translationZh": "使用费用计入您的 Enterprise Hub 组织当前的月度账单周期。您可以随时在 Enterprise Hub 组织的账单设置中查看当前和以往的使用情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14324218e85ff505",
      "translationZh": "支持的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "089ef2b6dbb34fa9",
      "translationZh": "模型 ID",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "352ad40f8772695e",
      "translationZh": "H100 GPU 数量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8428e5307217df38",
      "translationZh": "利用 NVIDIA TensorRT-LLM 加速 AI 推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "976c70f49b798f20",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴能继续与 NVIDIA 合作，突破 AI 推理性能和可及性的边界。我们当前工作的一个重点是将 NVIDIA TensorRT-LLM 库集成到 Hugging Face 的 Text Generation Inference（TGI）框架中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef026ecc27f45793",
      "translationZh": "在不久的将来，我们将分享更多关于结合 NVIDIA TensorRT-LLM 使用 TGI 的详细信息、基准测试和最佳实践。随着我们继续扩大与 NVIDIA 的合作，为全球开发者和组织带来更强大的 AI 能力，敬请期待更多令人振奋的进展！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
